## Retrospectives

When a systemic issue is found:
1. `bobby retro TKT-001 "pattern name"` — creates a retro
2. `bobby learn bobby-build "pattern" "description"` — adds to skill learnings

This feedback loop is what makes Bobby get smarter over time.

## Agents

### Product Definer (bobby-define-brief → -personas → -journeys → -features)
When told to "define the product", "write the brief", "personas", "journeys", or
"feature map", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-define/SKILL.md`.
- Brief → personas → journeys → feature map → blueprint, one ⛳ human gate per stage
- Artifacts locked in `.bobby/product/`; the epic then moves to planning
- Run the chain with `bobby run define <epicId>` (resumes mid-pipeline)

### Planner (bobby-plan)
When told to "plan", "refine", or "brainstorm", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-plan/SKILL.md`.
- **Epic mode**: breaks big ideas into child tickets
- **Refine mode**: creates plan.md + test-cases.md for a ticket

### Builder (bobby-build)
When told to "build" or "work tickets", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-build/SKILL.md`.
- TDD red-green-refactor cycle
- Commits code to current branch

### Reviewer (bobby-review)
When told to "review", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-review/SKILL.md`.
- Reviews git diff + acceptance criteria
- Separate agent from build for fresh perspective

### Tester (bobby-test)
When told to "test", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-test/SKILL.md`.
- Tests through the **live running app** (browser, API calls) — never runs specs (build/review already did that)

### Shipper (bobby-ship)
When told to "ship", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-ship/SKILL.md`.
- Creates PR, waits for CI, merges, and deploys using whatever mechanism the repo needs (Vercel, Heroku promotion branch, GitHub Actions, npm publish, or nothing — detected per repo)

### UX Designer (bobby-ux)
When told to "review design" or "UX audit", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-ux/SKILL.md`.
- Reviews live app through the browser — never reads source code

### Product Manager (bobby-pm)
When told to "PM review" or "product review", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-pm/SKILL.md`.
- Reviews live app, identifies UX gaps and feature opportunities

### Security Auditor (bobby-security)
When told to "security audit" or "security review", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-security/SKILL.md`.
- OWASP Top 10 + STRIDE threat modeling on changed code
- Only flags findings with 8/10+ confidence and concrete exploit scenarios

### Debugger (bobby-debug)
When told to "debug" or "investigate", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-debug/SKILL.md`.
- Systematic root-cause debugging: Reproduce → Hypothesize → Trace → Verify → Fix
- Scope-locked: only fixes the bug, never refactors

### Freewill (bobby-freewill)
When told to "freewill", "skip the stages", or "just do the whole ticket", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-freewill/SKILL.md`.
- One agent takes the ticket from start to shipping on deliberately few instructions
- Runs on Opus by default — a goal plus its invariants, no procedure
- No fresh-eyes reviewer: security-sensitive, underspecified, and epic-sized tickets go back to `default`/`secure`

### Documentation (bobby-docs)
When told to "update docs" or "document release", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-docs/SKILL.md`.
- Updates README, <%= paths.rules %>, CHANGELOG after shipping
- Only changes documentation that is now stale

### Performance (bobby-performance)
When told to "benchmark" or "check performance", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-performance/SKILL.md`.
- Measures page load times, resource sizes, request counts

### Lighthouse Audit (bobby-lighthouse)
When told "lighthouse audit", "audit the pages", or "which pages need fixing", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-lighthouse/SKILL.md`.
- Sweeps Performance, Accessibility, Best Practices and SEO across page TEMPLATES, not just the homepage
- Ranks gaps by live URL count from the sitemap, and proposes tickets only on failing audits with real DOM nodes, never on a score
- NOT the `bobby audit` command, which scores codebase production readiness instead
- Compares against baseline, flags regressions

### Watchdog (bobby-watchdog)
When told to "watchdog check" or "verify deploy", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-watchdog/SKILL.md`.
- Post-deploy health verification: page loads, console errors, API responses
- Files critical bugs for any failures

### Architect (bobby-arch)
When told to "run arch", "discover architecture", or "regenerate wakeup", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-arch/SKILL.md`.
- Autonomously reads the codebase and writes three files agents use to start work faster
- `.bobby/architecture.md` — full reference
- `.bobby/architecture-wakeup.md` — compressed ~300-token summary (loaded by all agents before starting)
- `.bobby/decisions.yaml` — architectural decisions enforced by bobby-review

### Ticket Intake (bobby-ticket-intake)
When told to "intake", "convert spec", or "create ticket from PM spec", load `<%= paths.skills %>/bobby-ticket-intake/SKILL.md`.
- Parses a pasted PM/JIRA spec and creates a fully-populated ticket — no placeholders
- Leaves ticket in backlog; engineer decides when to advance

## Bobby CLI Commands

```
bobby ticket create -t "Title" --type bug -p high   # Create ticket
bobby ticket create -t "Epic" --epic                # Create epic (breaks down)
bobby ticket create -t "..." -a bobby-build --found-in TKT-001   # File an out-of-scope finding for product review
bobby ticket triage                                 # Review backlog; agent-filed tickets first
bobby run define TKT-001                            # Product definition: brief → personas → journeys → features → blueprint
bobby blueprint                                     # See the whole plan on one page before building
bobby ticket list                                   # Show board
bobby ticket list --blocked                         # Show blocked tickets
bobby ticket view TKT-001                           # View ticket
bobby ticket view TKT-001 --plan                    # View plan
bobby ticket move TKT-001 review                   # Move to reviewing
bobby ticket move TKT-001 reject "reason"          # Reject back to building
bobby ticket move TKT-001 block "reason"           # Block ticket
bobby ticket move TKT-001 unblock                  # Unblock ticket
bobby run next TKT-001                      # Slow mode: next agent for stage
bobby run workflow TKT-001                  # Fast mode: auto-chain all agents
bobby run plan                              # Batch: plan all tickets in planning
bobby run ship                              # Ship all ready tickets
bobby run arch                              # Discover + document architecture (wakeup + decisions)
bobby run intake                            # Convert pasted PM spec → ticket
bobby run ux                                # Freeform UX design review
bobby run pm                                # Freeform PM product review
bobby run security TKT-001                  # Security audit (OWASP + STRIDE)
bobby run debug TKT-001                     # Root-cause debugging
bobby run docs                              # Update docs after shipping
bobby run performance                              # Performance benchmarking
bobby run lighthouse                               # Lighthouse audit of page templates
bobby run watchdog                            # Post-deploy health check
bobby retro TKT-001 "pattern"              # Create retrospective
bobby retro --weekly                        # Weekly retro with metrics
bobby learn bobby-build "pattern" "desc"    # Add learning
bobby decision add --id <id> --fact "..." --why "..."   # Record an architectural decision
bobby decision list                         # Active decisions (bobby-review enforces these)
bobby upgrade                               # Upgrade Bobby to latest version
```
